  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewed EU Support to the Paris Peace Forum for 2026-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under NDICI-GE-GC-Partnerships MAAP 2025-2027, DG INTPA renews support to PPF for 2026-2027.PPF serves as an important &#xbf;whole of society&#xbf; platform for generating multi-stakeholder exchanges and (new) partnerships to reinforce rules-based multilateralism and inclusiveness while finding common solutions to global challenges. The EU support over the remaining years of the ongoing MFF 2021-2027 will enable PPF to maintain its role as catalyst for addressing global challenges (as both convener and policy steerer).The Specific Objectives of this action are to: Strengthen, through the PPF platform, multilateral efforts to address global challenges; Promote, through the PPF platform, the EU global governance agenda, the EU values, policy priorities, and strategic interests; Enhance the EU role in PPF governing structures (PPF&#xbf;s General Assembly and Executive Committee, where the EU will be sitting until at least 2027);&amp;nbsp;Secure EU participation and visibility in PPF events and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
